				</h3>
				<p class="font-body" style="line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
					Navigating bridal alterations can feel intimidating when seamstresses quote complex terminology like "horsehair braid" and "French pickup points." Here is how to use this tool to build an accurate estimate before your first salon appointment:
				</p>

				<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
					<div style="background: var(--bg-paper); border: 2px solid var(--fg-pencil); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.25rem;">
